    "title": "Constrained Subsequence Sum",
    "category": "Queue",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given an integer array nums and an integer k, find the maximum sum of a non-empty subsequence such that for every two consecutive chosen elements, their indices differ by at most k. Return the maximum possible sum.",
